## C. Payment Calculations

Maintain consistent backend calculations.

Net assigned fee equals gross assigned fee minus applicable concessions.

Remaining principal equals net assigned fee minus successfully recorded payments allocated to that fee.

Outstanding balance equals remaining principal plus applicable unpaid late fines.

Respect institutional fine rules, payment allocations, and configured grace periods.

Use consistent monetary precision.

Pending or failed payments must not be treated as successful payments.

Do not count the same transaction twice.

## D. Payment Interface

